    "heading": "Sorcerer Subclass: Draconic Sorcery",
    "lineStart": 4155,
    "lineEnd": 4159
  },
  "section": "3.278",
  "rulesText": "Breathe the Magic of Dragons\n\nYour innate magic comes from the gift of a dragon. Perhaps an ancient dragon facing death bequeathed some of its magical power to you or your ancestor. You might have absorbed magic from a site infused with dragons' power. Or perhaps you handled a treasure taken from a dragon's hoard that was steeped in draconic power. Or you might have a dragon for an ancestor."
}
